      179.85,
      229.61,
      383.85,
      240.95
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE TRUSTS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 87)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      255.65,
      401.9,
      279.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      294.65,
      401.88,
      318.95
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Trusts (Amendment)Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      333.65,
      401.92,
      383.99
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Trusts Ordinance (Chapter 87)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended by the repeal of paragraph (e) of that section andthe substitution therefor of the following paragraphs:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      398.57,
      401.88,
      435.95
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(e)\u201cbeneficiary\u201d means a person, or a defined ordefinitely ascertainable class of persons, for whosebenefit the confidence is accepted;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      450.53,
      401.9,
      474.95
    ],
    "text": "(ee)\u201cprescribed\u201d means prescribed by regulations madeunder this Act;\u201d .",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      489.53,
      401.88,
      526.91
    ],
    "text": "3.The following new sections are hereby insertedimmediately after section 6 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as sections 6A and 6B of that enactment:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      541.61,
      401.88,
      591.95
    ],
    "text": "6A. (1) The Registrar-General shall prepareand maintain a register containing suchinformation as may be prescribed of every trust,created in compliance with section 5.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      606.53,
      401.88,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "(2) The trustee of any immovable ormovable property shall forward to the Registrar-General for the purpose of subsection (1), allsuch information relating to the trust, as maybe prescribed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      334.63,
      451.29,
      372.5
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 3of Chapter87.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      492.19,
      452.14,
      539.66
    ],
    "text": "Insertion ofnew sections6A and 6B inthe principalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
